      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hi, I'm preping a chemistry demo for my students about why cutting onions makes your eyes sting. Can you explain the specific chemical pathway from the moment the knife hits the onion to the actual irritation in the eyes? I need to explain the enzymatic part. Thanks.",
