    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a good start for the basics. Could you go into a bit more detail regarding the specific sulfur-containing precursors involved in that enzymatic reaction? I also want to make sure I explain why the effect feels so sudden and aggressive—like it's almost targeting the eyes specifically. Why does it happen so fast once the cells are broken?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
